<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Reliance Bancorp rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Reliance Bancorp rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said analyst John Kline initiated coverage of Reliance Bancorp Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.90 per share for 1997 and $2.07 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- set target price of $28.</p>
<p>-- Reliance shares ended Friday at 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
